@host = http://localhost:5088

GET {{host}}/
Accept: application/json

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Portfolio HNW
GET {{host}}/api/portfolio/summary
Accept: application/json

### Scanner — texto (estafa)
POST {{host}}/api/scanner/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inputType": "text",
  "content": "URGENTE: transfiera 80.000 USD en bitcoin ahora o su cuenta será bloqueada. Envíe su frase semilla de 12 palabras."
}

### Scanner — URL
POST {{host}}/api/scanner/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inputType": "url",
  "content": "http://secure-update-bank.xyz/login"
}

### Scanner — contrato
POST {{host}}/api/scanner/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inputType": "contract",
  "content": "El firmante cede derechos patrimoniales mediante poder irrevocable, sin retracto, y autoriza el wire SWIFT inmediato."
}
